  "description": "Certificate of\r\nLawful Proposed Development:&nbsp;Change of use from HMO for up to 6 People (C4) to HMO for 7 people (Sui Generis)&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore NOT a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;padding: 0.75pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed use of the dwellinghouse as a House of Multiple Occupancy (HMO) up to 7 person&amp;nbsp;exceeds the limitations of Use Class C4 which limits the number of occupants to&amp;nbsp;6 persons. Therefore, the proposed development would fail to&amp;nbsp;be within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;padding: 0.75pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
